# Sentinel IoT Platform — Mosquitto Topic ACL
#
# Applied to ALL clients when allow_anonymous true (no per-user rules without password_file).
# With password_file enabled, add per-user blocks:
#
#   user sentinel-backend
#   topic readwrite factory/telemetry
#   topic readwrite factory/telemetry/dlq
#
#   user sensor-device
#   topic write factory/telemetry
#
# Mosquitto 2.0: topics not matched by any rule are DENIED by default when acl_file is set.

# Telemetry ingestion — devices publish, backend subscribes
topic write factory/telemetry
topic read  factory/telemetry

# Dead-letter queue — backend publishes rejected messages, operators may read
topic write factory/telemetry/dlq
topic read  factory/telemetry/dlq
